## Technical Stack
- Framework: Next.js (App Router)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Language: TypeScript
- State: LocalStorage for persistent mock data (appointments, user profile, billing)

## Design Tokens (Clinical Precision Style)
- Font: Manrope (Sans-serif)
- Colors:
  - Primary: #A1D6D7 (Light Blue — active states, buttons, toggles, icons, highlights)
  - Secondary / Inactive: #9AB0C5 (Muted Blue — labels, inactive tabs, secondary text)
  - Background: #F8FAFB (Light Blue/Grey tint)
  - Tooth Status: Healthy (White), Treated (Blue), Caries (Red), Removed (Grey)
- Border Radius: 12px - 16px for cards and containers
- Shadows: Minimal or none (use thin borders #E2E8F0 instead)

## Color Usage Rules
- ALWAYS use #A1D6D7 for: active nav items, primary buttons, toggles (on state), progress indicators, selected states, accent icons.
- ALWAYS use #9AB0C5 for: inactive nav labels, placeholder text, disabled elements, secondary captions.
- NEVER use the old green #00665E in any new code.

## Development Rules
- Use 'use client' directive only when interactivity is needed.
- Maintain a single source of truth in LocalStorage for appointment data.
- All Russian text should be handled correctly with proper date formatting (e.g., "Пятница, 2 мая").
- Buttons must have a visible active/pressed state (scale-95).
- Follow the modular structure in the /screens directory.

## Naming Conventions
- Components: PascalCase (e.g., AppointmentCard.tsx)
- Types/Interfaces: PascalCase with 'I' prefix or clear descriptive names (e.g., IAppointment).
- Routes: Lowercase with underscores (matching the existing /screens folders).

"При создании новых UI-компонентов или страниц админ-панели, всегда обращайся к скриншотам в папке .cursor/reference_images, чтобы соблюдать визуальный стиль (отступы, цвета, расположение элементов)."